@RepBonamici @FGSchools We don’t have a federal government to feed kids at municipal schools. 

Perhaps congress isn’t the best place for you. 

Abolish the department of education.

@RepBonamici @FGSchools Yes, kids need food….. 
they also need a good education system.
So many teachers are disillusioned with OR education system. They have seen education tank because no discipline is allowed and no policy that kids have to be in class. Kids wander halls and teachers are leaving OR.

@RepBonamici It's complicated because health insurance is provided by employers. 

Health insurance companies are not "insurance", they charge a % of premiums to companies. 

Decouple health insurance from employers and the industry would thrive... honestly.
